{"2411980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "AMEDAMA", "steam_appid": 2411980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3422890], "detailed_description": "<strong>Soul-Shifting Showdowns: </strong>Lacking a physical form, you'll need to shift your soul to other bodies on the quest to find your sister. Possession puts you in complete control of whoever and whatever you inhabit, giving you access to a variety of weapons and fighting styles. Depending on your current body, you'll face different foes and encounter new faces on your incorporeal journey.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/extras/3c85625fc6bf3c7d1117bfb6dd49ccbf.poster.avif?t=1769068208\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/extras/3c85625fc6bf3c7d1117bfb6dd49ccbf.webm?t=1769068208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/extras/3c85625fc6bf3c7d1117bfb6dd49ccbf.mp4?t=1769068208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Inclement Intrigue:</strong> This human drama plays out against the rain-soaked backdrop of mid 19th century Japan, rendered in an evocative pixel style. In the sombre world of AMEDAMA, beauty and darkness are two sides of the same coin.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/extras/277fbd1af6f84dcbcea21a2f0c844581.poster.avif?t=1769068208\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/extras/277fbd1af6f84dcbcea21a2f0c844581.webm?t=1769068208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/extras/277fbd1af6f84dcbcea21a2f0c844581.mp4?t=1769068208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Reincarnation, Repercussions:</strong> As you relive the same seven day period over and over again, your choices will impact the story unfolding around you. Who will you speak to? How will you intervene? The decisions, and the outcomes, are all up to you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/extras/6a33ea9eb768fe6792e304c13b9271f7.poster.avif?t=1769068208\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/extras/6a33ea9eb768fe6792e304c13b9271f7.webm?t=1769068208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/extras/6a33ea9eb768fe6792e304c13b9271f7.mp4?t=1769068208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Counteraction using the sword technique of Usetsu Tensei sword style: </strong>Where Yushin, having mastered the key to battles, employs the technique known as 'Misty Riposte.' By countering the opponent's attacks, significant damage is dealt in a counteraction.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/extras/faad2c540d0a3217501d67a3dda14c3c.poster.avif?t=1769068208\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/extras/faad2c540d0a3217501d67a3dda14c3c.webm?t=1769068208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/extras/faad2c540d0a3217501d67a3dda14c3c.mp4?t=1769068208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Aihama, Japan. The final years of the Edo period. One rain-drenched evening, a group of men burst into the town’s brother and sister-run umbrella shop. Yushin is cut down in front of his sister Yui, leaving her alone in the world. The next thing he knows, he is looking down at his own stricken corpse—a soul without a body. The grim incident shatters the peace in this quiet backwater. Lurking beneath the surface is an intricate, deep-rooted plot, shrouded in mystery. Until Yui is safe, not even death is enough to extinguish Yushin’s soul. He'll stop at nothing on his quest, shifting from body to body, possessing anyone and anything to rescue his sister. But with just seven days before his soul departs this world—can he save Yui in time? <br><br>This is a tale of rain, reincarnation, and revenge.<br><br>Development / Marketing: IzanagiGames<br>Planning: ACQUIRE<br>Character design: lack (Fate/Grand Order, Touken Ranbu)<br>Soundtrack: Yuko Komiyama (Monster Hunter series)<br><br>©️ IzanagiGames, Inc. &amp; ACQUIRE Corp. All Rights Reserved.", "about_the_game": "<strong>Soul-Shifting Showdowns: </strong>Lacking a physical form, you'll need to shift your soul to other bodies on the quest to find your sister. Possession puts you in complete control of whoever and whatever you inhabit, giving you access to a variety of weapons and fighting styles. Depending on your current body, you'll face different foes and encounter new faces on your incorporeal journey.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/extras/3c85625fc6bf3c7d1117bfb6dd49ccbf.poster.avif?t=1769068208\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/extras/3c85625fc6bf3c7d1117bfb6dd49ccbf.webm?t=1769068208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/extras/3c85625fc6bf3c7d1117bfb6dd49ccbf.mp4?t=1769068208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Inclement Intrigue:</strong> This human drama plays out against the rain-soaked backdrop of mid 19th century Japan, rendered in an evocative pixel style. In the sombre world of AMEDAMA, beauty and darkness are two sides of the same coin.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/extras/277fbd1af6f84dcbcea21a2f0c844581.poster.avif?t=1769068208\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/extras/277fbd1af6f84dcbcea21a2f0c844581.webm?t=1769068208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/extras/277fbd1af6f84dcbcea21a2f0c844581.mp4?t=1769068208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Reincarnation, Repercussions:</strong> As you relive the same seven day period over and over again, your choices will impact the story unfolding around you. Who will you speak to? How will you intervene? The decisions, and the outcomes, are all up to you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/extras/6a33ea9eb768fe6792e304c13b9271f7.poster.avif?t=1769068208\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/extras/6a33ea9eb768fe6792e304c13b9271f7.webm?t=1769068208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/extras/6a33ea9eb768fe6792e304c13b9271f7.mp4?t=1769068208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Counteraction using the sword technique of Usetsu Tensei sword style: </strong>Where Yushin, having mastered the key to battles, employs the technique known as 'Misty Riposte.' By countering the opponent's attacks, significant damage is dealt in a counteraction.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/extras/faad2c540d0a3217501d67a3dda14c3c.poster.avif?t=1769068208\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/extras/faad2c540d0a3217501d67a3dda14c3c.webm?t=1769068208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/extras/faad2c540d0a3217501d67a3dda14c3c.mp4?t=1769068208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Aihama, Japan. The final years of the Edo period. One rain-drenched evening, a group of men burst into the town’s brother and sister-run umbrella shop. Yushin is cut down in front of his sister Yui, leaving her alone in the world. The next thing he knows, he is looking down at his own stricken corpse—a soul without a body. The grim incident shatters the peace in this quiet backwater. Lurking beneath the surface is an intricate, deep-rooted plot, shrouded in mystery. Until Yui is safe, not even death is enough to extinguish Yushin’s soul. He'll stop at nothing on his quest, shifting from body to body, possessing anyone and anything to rescue his sister. But with just seven days before his soul departs this world—can he save Yui in time? <br><br>This is a tale of rain, reincarnation, and revenge.<br><br>Development / Marketing: IzanagiGames<br>Planning: ACQUIRE<br>Character design: lack (Fate/Grand Order, Touken Ranbu)<br>Soundtrack: Yuko Komiyama (Monster Hunter series)<br><br>©️ IzanagiGames, Inc. &amp; ACQUIRE Corp. All Rights Reserved.", "short_description": "Side-scrolling, soul-shifting sandbox action adventure brought to life with a striking new 2D style! With only his soul remaining, Yushin must fight tooth and nail, possessing body after body on a quest to find his sister. With just seven days left until his soul departs, can he save her in time?", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/header.jpg?t=1769068208", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769068208", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411980/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769068208", "website": "https://amedama.info/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11 or later<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core i7</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Steam OS 3 or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "©️ IzanagiGames, Inc. & ACQUIRE Corp. All Rights Reserved.", "developers": ["IzanagiGames", "ACQUIRE Corp."], "publishers": ["IzanagiGames"], "demos": [{"appid": 2491140, "description": ""}], "price_overview"